# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Solaryn's Expedition — a questing / world-exploration toolkit.
#
# Slash commands:  /sol  (also /expedition)
#
# Target: WoW: Forever, currently in beta (_classic_beta_, interface 16001,
# build 70124). Verified against addons that load on that client, which use
# C_QuestLog.{GetInfo,GetQuestObjectives,GetNextWaypointForMap,IsQuestFlaggedCompleted}
# and C_Map.{GetMapChildrenInfo,GetBestMapForUnit,GetPlayerMapPosition,
#             GetWorldPosFromMapPos,SetUserWaypoint,CanSetUserWaypointOnMap}.
#
# Deliberately NOT used, because these do not exist in this API:
#   C_Map.GetAllMapInfo             -> zones come from walking GetMapChildrenInfo
#                                     from the Cosmic root (946) instead
#   C_QuestLog.GetActiveQuestMapIDs -> candidate maps are derived from the
#                                     player's map + its parent chain
#
# Load order matters: Init creates the shared namespace and event dispatcher,
# Constants must land before Util (Util reads ns.Defaults), and Explored must
# load before Suggest (Suggest reads ns.Explored).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Init.lua
Core_Constants.lua
Core_Util.lua
Core_Overrides.lua
Core_ZoneData.lua
Core_Explored.lua
Core_QuestData.lua
Core_QuestGivers.lua
Core_Route.lua
Core_Suggest.lua
Core_MapPins.lua
SolarynExpedition.xml
Core_Slash.lua
UI_Widgets.lua
UI_Panel.lua
UI_Minimap.lua
UI_HUD.lua
UI_Tooltip.lua
UI_Options.lua
